polarFFT

  These are examples of the application of the NFFT for the computation of the

  - polar FFT: polar_fft_test.c

  - modified polar FFT: mpolar_fft_test.c

  - pseudopolar (linogram) FFT: linogram_fft_test.c.

  Use the Matlab script file fft_test.m for a demonstration.


  Compiling:

  polar_fft_test.c, mpolar_fft_test.c and linogram_fft_test.c include
  nfft3mp.h, which selects the floating-point precision from a preprocessor
  macro. The build system defines it. To compile such a program yourself,
  define the macro that matches the installed library, e.g. for double
  precision

    gcc -DNFFT_PRECISION_DOUBLE polar_fft_test.c -lnfft3 -lfftw3 -lm

  or use NFFT_PRECISION_SINGLE with -lnfft3f -lfftw3f, or
  NFFT_PRECISION_LONG_DOUBLE with -lnfft3l -lfftw3l.

  Reference:

 [1]  M. Fenn, S. Kunis, and D. Potts. On the computation of the polar FFT.
      Appl. Comput. Harmon. Anal., accepted.

 [2]  D. Potts, and G. Steidl, G. A new linogram algorithm for computerized 
      tomography. IMA J. Numer. Anal. 21, 769-782, 2001
